OL,3,GNEWSANo homosexual offence pardons
OL,4,Asince law introduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been no pardons for
OL,7,Fconvictions for now abolished gay sex
OL,8,Foffences in the eight years since a
OL,9,Fscheme was introduced in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FThree people have applied to the
OL,13,Fpardons and disregards scheme since the
OL,14,Flaws introduction, however their
OL,15,Fapplications did not meet the relevant
OL,16,Fcriteria.
OL,18,FOffences include gross indecency and
OL,19,Fprocuring others to commit homosexual
OL,20,Facts. The activity must have been
OL,21,Fconsensual, with a person aged 17 or
OL,22,Fover and must not still be an offence.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
