OL,3,GNEWSANo homosexual offence pardons
OL,4,Asince law introduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Justice (DoJ) said a
OL,7,Freview of the scope of the scheme is
OL,8,Ftaking place, with a view to making
OL,9,Freform proposals to ministers after the
OL,10,Fnext assembly elections.
